540-4932-b57a-4dd773f8790d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=11163d67261e5c4a572b9aaa32009099, https://si.imgix.net/bf3c05cf/uploads/origins/5d414483-8540-4932-b57a-4dd773f8790d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d50bc0cbb4829c0b960eb73d50f44bf7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf3c05cf/uploads/origins/5d414483-8540-4932-b57a-4dd773f8790d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e3f87b31d0927035bc13812de451d49e 3x"}, "body": "Heyyo, it's Ulti again!\n\nI've loved what you've done so far! This time around though, I'll be getting some solo art and pushing ya to your physique limit!\n\nI love how you draw physiques, so I'd love if you could draw Heral in the Yakuza reference outfit I included with good physique showing similarly to how you did in previous art, no sword or gloves though. Please do so in a pose that showcases the full body from hair to feet including his tail, alongside maybe behind or near him an armor stand similar to the possible pose picture included that has his typical armor and scouter on, and possibly gloves and skintight thrown around messily as he now has a new outfit.\n\nFor the face, I'd like if it could be a serious expression with his mouth open either as if talking in an annoyed manner or just overall something that can showcase his sharp canine teeth. I included references for the fangs.\n\nI look forward to what you'll do, I included some extra possible physique pictures if needed, but I doubt it since you already draw physiques so well!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SOYCpZM_srQKNPSCAZfoyzQop1uBXBMH?usp=share_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kusu_den/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1039292, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"s